/// allowances of the progressive withholding; without one the personal allowance applies. PDPA: family and
/// financial data given by the agent for withholding only; read by the agent and Finance
/// (`agent_tax_declarations.review`); retained 10 years after the tax year (Revenue Code s.87/3).
